---
// Editorial lede under the hub hero, set like the service pages' intro: one
// defining sentence beside the studio's three plain facts.
---

<section class="hub-intro">
	<div class="container intro-inner">
		<p class="intro-lede">
			Every system in the residence, from the lighting and shades to the cinema, the climate and the gates, is
			designed by one team with the others in mind, and answers to one quiet interface.
		</p>
		<ul class="intro-facts" aria-label="PROJECT: automate at a glance">
			<li><strong>17+</strong><span>Years of expertise</span></li>
			<li><strong>400+</strong><span>Los Angeles residences</span></li>
			<li><strong>CEDIA · HTA</strong><span>Certified integrator</span></li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hub-intro {
		padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8.5rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
	}

	.intro-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 8fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
		gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
		align-items: end;
	}

	.intro-lede {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2.3vw, 2.125rem);
		font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
		line-height: 1.42;
		letter-spacing: -0.005em;
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.intro-facts li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: var(--space-4);
		padding-block: var(--space-4);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.intro-facts li:last-child {
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.intro-facts strong {
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
		color: var(--color-text);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.intro-facts span {
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		text-align: right;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.intro-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			align-items: start;
		}
	}
</style>
